    "['peer [parameter1] send-community extended', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols bgp group <group-name> neighbor 3.3.3.3 family l2vpn unicast', 'parent_command': ['set routing-options autonomous-system [parameter1]', 'family l2vpn'], 'root': 'set routing-options autonomous-system [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"##\\nset protocols bgp group <group-name> neighbor 3.3.3.3 family l2vpn unicast\\nset protocols bgp group <group-name> neighbor 3.3.3.3 export send-community extended\\n##\\n\\nNote: \\n1. In Juniper, you need to specify the BGP group name (replace `<group-name>` with your actual group)\\n2. The `family l2vpn unicast` is required for L2VPN/VPLS signaling (equivalent to Huawei's `l2vpn-ad-family`)\\n3. The `export send-community extended` matches Huawei's behavior of sending extended community attributes to the neighbor\", 'trans_template': 'set protocols bgp group <group-name> neighbor 3.3.3.3 family l2vpn unicast'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols bgp group <group-name> neighbor 3.3.3.3 export send-community extended', 'parent_command': ['set routing-options autonomous-system [parameter1]', 'family l2vpn'], 'root': 'set routing-options autonomous-system [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"##\\nset protocols bgp group <group-name> neighbor 3.3.3.3 family l2vpn unicast\\nset protocols bgp group <group-name> neighbor 3.3.3.3 export send-community extended\\n##\\n\\nNote: \\n1. In Juniper, you need to specify the BGP group name (replace `<group-name>` with your actual group)\\n2. The `family l2vpn unicast` is required for L2VPN/VPLS signaling (equivalent to Huawei's `l2vpn-ad-family`)\\n3. The `export send-community extended` matches Huawei's behavior of sending extended community attributes to the neighbor\", 'trans_template': 'set protocols bgp group <group-name> neighbor 3.3.3.3 export send-community extended'}]]": 1,
